<title>CANADA: BCE to buy back up to 1.6 pct of shares.</title>
<headline>BCE to buy back up to 1.6 pct of shares.</headline>
<dateline>MONTREAL 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>BCE Inc said on Thursday that it planned to buy back up to 5 million common shares, or 1.6 percent of those outstanding between Oct 30, 1996 and October 29, 1997.</p>
<p>The repurchase of shares under the company's normal course issue bid would be made through the Toronto and Montreal stock exchanges, which accepted its notice of intention.</p>
<p>At September 30, BCE had 317,355,154 common shares outstanding.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Montreal bureau (514) 985-2434</p>
</text>
